# Standard proposal records

This directory contains the consumer-owned, tracked JSON authority for reusable improvements originating in `{{PROJECT_TITLE}}`. Keep one record per proposal and validate it against `schema/standard-proposal-record-v1.json`.

Generated scrubbed previews belong under ignored `output/standard-proposals/` and can be rebuilt. Do not store consumer files or attachments there for upload.

The adapted `standard-change-form-v1.yml` is the byte-level form contract bound into prepared and approved payloads. If the published Standard form or required labels do not match it, the local workflow fails closed and leaves submission with the user.

`standard-proposals/registry.json` is intentionally absent. Acceptance and release registry authority belongs to the DenchCo Knowledge Base Wiki Standard, not this consumer repository. A registry observation never changes this project's pin or adoption state without separate project authority.
